    missingness is non-random: mr-native-tick.sh:57-78 skips the FINISHED write whenever a
    cost-bearing row already exists within 12h — i.e. whenever the slice agent self-recorded — so
    `unavailable` correlates with WELL-BEHAVED slices.

    No `--min-rows` override and no `MR_*_MEM` override (A5): an override is a surface for greening
