#     it supersedes) by the TESTER, never retargeted to match the code, and any correction must
#     preserve or strengthen the bite plus carry a one-line rationale tying it to the spec.
#   * Every fixture runs inside a tempfile.TemporaryDirectory and cleans up. Nothing here writes
#     into $MEM, appends to the real ledger, or touches the real handoff — asserted at the end of
#     selftest() by a before/after snapshot of both the self-located and the hardcoded-production
#     copies of those files.
